#
# ## crates/ufo-types (#511) — Implementation Summary
# 
# Built 2026-06-28. 40 tests, zero warnings, edition 2024 (workspace).
# 
# ### Flat 5-variant UfoStereotype enum
# 
# ```rust
# pub enum UfoStereotype {
#     Kind(String),
#     SubKind { name: String, parent: String },
#     Role(String),
#     Relator(String),
#     Mode(String),
# }
# ```
# 
# Design decision: Used the HANDOFF's flat 5-variant enum rather than the PRD's
# deeper hierarchy (UfoCategory → Endurant → Kind). The flat enum is simpler and
# maps directly to the `record_is_a()` string interface in evidence.rs.
# 
# ### Stereotyped trait (NS-9 bridge)
# 
# ```rust
# pub trait Stereotyped {
#     fn ufo_stereotype(&self) -> UfoStereotype;
# }
# ```
# 
# Domain types implement this to declare their UFO classification. The Display
# impl produces `"Variant:value"` strings for `record_is_a()` calls.
# 
# ### Satisfies<C> trait
# 
# ```rust
# pub trait Satisfies<C> {
#     fn satisfies(&self, constraint: &C) -> SatisfiesResult;
# }
# ```
# 
# `SatisfiesResult` carries `disposition` (Satisfied/Violated{reason}/Unknown),
# `confidence` (f64), `evidence_nodes` (Vec<NodeId>), and `ufo_category`.
# 
# ### EvidenceBridge
# 
# ```rust
# impl EvidenceBridge {
#     pub fn evaluate<S, C>(subject: &S, constraint: &C) -> (SatisfiesResult, UfoStereotype, Vec<String>)
#     where S: Satisfies<C> + Stereotyped, C: IsoAuditable
# }
# ```
# 
# Pure computation helper — produces stereotype + ISO labels without calling any
# evidence functions. Actual `record_is_a()` / `record_audited_by()` calls happen
# in the domain crate (#513) using these labels.
# 
# ### ISO wrappers
# 
# | Type | Standard | Validation |
# |------|----------|-----------|
# | `Lei` | ISO 17442 | ISO 7064 Mod 97-10 check digit (validated against real Deutsche Bank LEI) |
# | `Iso4217` | ISO 4217 | 3-uppercase-letter currency code |
# | `Ifrs9Classification` | IFRS 9 | FVPL (§4.1.4), FVOCI (§4.1.2A), AmortizedCost (§4.1.2) |
# 
# ### Files
# 
# ```
# crates/ufo-types/
#   Cargo.toml           — workspace-inherited metadata
#   src/lib.rs           — module declarations + re-exports
#   src/stereotype.rs    — UfoStereotype enum + Stereotyped trait (217 lines)
#   src/satisfies.rs     — Satisfies<C> trait + EvidenceBridge (425 lines)
#   src/iso.rs           — Lei, Iso4217, Ifrs9Classification (381 lines)
# ```
# 
# ### Recipes
# 
# ```bash
# just ufo-check        # cargo check -p ufo-types
# just ufo-test         # cargo test -p ufo-types (40 tests)
# just ufo-doc          # cargo doc -p ufo-types --open
# just ufo-watch        # cargo watch -x 'check -p ufo-types'
# just tax-lawyer-test  # ufo-types + ledgrrr test
# ```
# 
